                               <a href=\"#/2428963\">1084B28</a>\n                                           .</p><p>1. Undo bolts and remove big end bearing caps complete with bearing\nshell.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2044063.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[8,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Proceed with the removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/2428879\">1028H10</a>\n                                           , bearing in mind to only\nwork on the cylinder involved.</p>"],[1,1,0,"<p>1. Remove the piston complete with connecting rod.</p><p>Remove the big end bearing shell.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2043702.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[4,1,0,"<p>1. Remove the piston complete with connecting rod.</p><p>2. Remove the big end bearing shell.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2044064.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[8,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Proceed with the refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/2428879\">1028H10</a>\n                                           , bearing in mind to only\nwork on the cylinder involved.</p>"],[1,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>1. Refit the piston - connecting rod assembly (1a), complete with\nhalf-bearing, using the tool (1b).</p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Make sure that the arrow, stamped\non the piston crown, is facing the timing side and that the number,\nstamped on the big end (matching cylinder), corresponds to the one\nof the connecting rod cap.</p></aside><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2043703.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[4,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>1. Refit the piston-connecting rod assemblies (1a) complete with\nbearing halves (1b) using a suitable tool (1c).</p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Make sure that the arrow, stamped\non the piston crown, is facing the timing side and that the number,\nstamped on the big end, corresponds to the one of the connecting\nrod cap.</p></aside><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2044065.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[1,1,0,"<p>1. Place the connecting rod cap, complete with half-bearing, back\nin its housing.</p><p>2. Tighten the bolts fixing the connecting rod caps to the recommended\ntorque using the angular tightening tool.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>BIG END BEARING CAPS</p></td><td><p>M8</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>2 + 40°</p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Protractor</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.860.942.000</p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2043704.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[4,1,0,"<p>1. Place the connecting rod cap, complete with half-bearing, back\nin its housing.</p><p>2. Tighten the bolts  fixing the connecting rod caps to the recommended\ntorque using the angular tightening tool.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>BIG END BEARING CAPS</p></td><td><p>M8</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>2 + 40°</p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Protractor</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.860.942.000</p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2044066.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[1,1,0,"<p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/2428963\">1084B28</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/2428866\">1020A20</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/2429110\">2110A60</a>\n                    